00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.788
The operation is too much of a risk.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.333
Concentrate on extracting the VIP. He's our top priority.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:25.335
It's not safe.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:28.797
Some of the hostages are disguised as terrorists.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:30.674
Are you certain?

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:38.724
We can't delay this operation any longer based on unconfirmed information.

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:42.519
Taking down five terrorists isn't a problem for us.

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:46.606
Don't you agree?

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.360
Let's go.

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.366
Move in.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.285
You can't. It's too dangerous.

00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:01.871
We need to act before there are more casualties.

00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:03.080
Move in.

00:02:03.081 --> 00:02:05.667
J, don't go! Don't do it!

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:09.796
- We're moving in. -  I said no!

00:03:34.172 --> 00:03:36.383
Stay here. I'll come back.

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.222
I remember.

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:44.266
Jeong Jinman.

00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:00.824
