Not fair.

00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:32.970
Why'd you come? You weren't supposed to be part of this operation.

00:08:32.971 --> 00:08:36.890
Hm As the leader, you should always be prepared, right?

00:08:36.891 --> 00:08:37.976
Wow. Good one.

