00:15:27.135 --> 00:15:30.638
The past is the past, and the present is the present.

00:15:33.516 --> 00:15:35.810
Oh. Is that the place?

00:15:45.736 --> 00:15:47.905
Stay here. I'll come back.

00:15:49.198 --> 00:15:51.993
STAFF ONLY

