Stay there!

00:16:11.554 --> 00:16:12.846
Just sit down, sit down!

00:16:12.847 --> 00:16:15.891
- How many are there? -  Two dead, three remaining.

00:16:15.892 --> 00:16:17.852
Two in front of the door, one inside the room.

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:20.396
Jun.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.357
Jun!

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:28.404
Bang!

00:16:33.701 --> 00:16:35.536
Shut up, shut up!

00:16:56.933 --> 00:16:59.185
We're from Korea. Don't be scared.

00:17:02.939 --> 00:17:04.982
Put the gun down. Or she will die.

