00:17:16.244 --> 00:17:17.245
Please!

00:17:18.496 --> 00:17:19.914
Please!

00:17:23.209 --> 00:17:24.752
No. Please.

00:17:25.294 --> 00:17:27.088
:cue

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.057
- Make way, make way. - Thanks for saving us.

00:17:39.058 --> 00:17:40.308
Yes, sir, I'm taking the hostages now.

00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:42.143
- Our pleasure. - Mm-hmm. Thank you.

00:17:42.144 --> 00:17:44.396
You'll be assisted back home by the embassy.

00:17:44.397 --> 00:17:46.856
That's what you get for not listening to me.

00:17:46.857 --> 00:17:48.525
What else was I supposed to do?

00:17:48.526 --> 00:17:51.195
You gotta stand down when I tell you not to move in!

00:17:54.282 --> 00:17:57.660
You'll get yourself into hot water if you keep being so reckless.

00:17:58.828 --> 00:18:00.829
- J, are you okay? - Yeah, I'm fine.

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:04.041
Kusanagi Jin. Team leader of Babylon.

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:06.710
Nobody goes harder than you.

00:18:06.711 --> 00:18:10.380
Jinman Jeong, Master Sergeant of Korean Special Forces.

00:18:10.381 --> 00:18:12.591
Business as usual, right?

00:18:12.592 --> 00:18:15.969
It would've been nice if Korean Forces had informed us.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:19.347
It caused us confusion in our operation, and we almost lost the mission.

00:18:19.348 --> 00:18:20.890
Are you Korean?

00:18:20.891 --> 00:18:22.517
Something like that.

00:18:24.312 --> 00:18:27.480
-  Yeah, it's cute. - Wanna wear it?

00:18:27.481 --> 00:18:28.773
- No, thanks. - Try it on.

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:30.817
Hey, J, maybe you should've worn it instead of Q.

00:18:30.818 --> 00:18:34.029
Hard to say. Without confirming with our Special Forces beforehand,

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:36.573
Rushing in could've harmed the foreign hostages.

00:18:36.574 --> 00:18:37.575
What?

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:39.702
Please take over for me.

00:18:41.203 --> 00:18:43.497
What? Uh, Jinman where are you going?

00:18:46.334 --> 00:18:47.335
Let's go!

00:18:49.712 --> 00:18:53.090
I didn't get to introduce myself. Q is what they call me.

00:18:54.008 --> 00:18:55.134
I'm Jeong Jinman.

00:18:56.093 --> 00:18:57.303
Your Korean is good.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:01.139
Ah, I have a Korean friend in Osaka.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.434
-  I've been studying. -  Oh, I see.

00:19:04.644 --> 00:19:08.605
The operation was classified, so I couldn't say anything.

00:19:08.606 --> 00:19:10.399
-  I'm sorry. -  I understand.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.988
Is that him? The person who saved me?

00:19:20.826 --> 00:19:21.827
Thank you.

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:24.830
Thank you.

00:19:29.126 --> 00:19:31.044
I'll come back to work right away.

00:19:31.045 --> 00:19:33.004
Don't come to the hospital. It's a hassle.

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.883
- I'll be there later, so behave yourself. -  What?

00:19:37.259 --> 00:19:40.304
That hurts.

00:19:41.972 --> 00:19:44.850
Uh I, um

00:19:46.519 --> 00:19:49.021
I really appreciate what you did.

00:19:49.647 --> 00:19:52.858
Would you like to get a drink?

00:19:55.528 --> 00:19:56.653
The drink is on me.

00:19:56.654 --> 00:19:58.446
We'll be leaving the country in a few hours.

00:19:58.447 --> 00:20:00.199
It was an unofficial operation.

00:20:02.243 --> 00:20:03.369
Ah

00:20:04.537 --> 00:20:05.621
Okay.

