00:20:22.513 --> 00:20:23.514
Excuse me.

00:20:25.266 --> 00:20:26.267
Yes?

00:20:35.234 --> 00:20:37.653
The next time we meet, we'll go have a drink together.

00:20:38.612 --> 00:20:40.322
Either in Japan or Korea.

00:20:46.454 --> 00:20:47.872
:cue

00:20:48.414 --> 00:20:50.415
Hello.

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:53.001
I look forward to your kind operation. Thank you.

00:20:53.002 --> 00:20:56.337
Hey. They'll think we're pushovers if you do that.

00:20:56.338 --> 00:20:59.382
I'm just honey trapping to help lower their guard a little.

00:20:59.383 --> 00:21:01.761
How are you honey trapping without any honey?

00:21:04.054 --> 00:21:06.723
