00:21:06.724 --> 00:21:09.517
Doesn't mean that we should be bulldogs.

00:21:09.518 --> 00:21:14.148
Leadership isn't coerced. It's something you have to earn.

00:21:16.317 --> 00:21:17.651
Nice to meet you.

00:21:22.281 --> 00:21:23.407
Oh, shit

00:21:29.538 --> 00:21:30.830
Gross.

00:21:30.831 --> 00:21:32.249
Why does it smell musty?

00:21:33.834 --> 00:21:35.503
I know it's not ideal.

00:21:36.337 --> 00:21:37.880
This is our accommodation.

00:21:38.923 --> 00:21:40.216
Make the best of it.

00:21:43.385 --> 00:21:44.595
Somebody's in there.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.497
You're the ones?

00:22:15.918 --> 00:22:18.754
You came all the way across the sea to capture Jeong Jinman?

00:22:24.468 --> 00:22:25.469
Hello.

00:22:26.095 --> 00:22:28.013
I'm Q. The team lead.

00:22:28.764 --> 00:22:29.890
A woman?

00:22:40.651 --> 00:22:41.694
Hey, one-eye.

00:22:42.319 --> 00:22:44.654
I don't have to know what you're saying

00:22:44.655 --> 00:22:47.241
To understand that your tone is damn cocky.

00:23:09.179 --> 00:23:10.805
It's unbelievable.

00:23:10.806 --> 00:23:12.933
They made off with the entire server

00:23:13.183 --> 00:23:16.769
And nothing's happened yet?

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.271
That's really weird.

00:23:18.272 --> 00:23:21.275
All the confidential data on the server is encrypted.

00:23:21.942 --> 00:23:24.611
Just because Jeong Jinman has the server,

00:23:24.612 --> 00:23:27.071
Doesn't mean he'll be able to un-encrypt it.

00:23:27.072 --> 00:23:30.034
Either Jinman hasn't cracked the code

00:23:31.452 --> 00:23:33.995
Or he's honoring the agreement to ceasefire.

00:23:33.996 --> 00:23:37.123
Jeong Jinman made that promise on his own.

00:23:37.124 --> 00:23:40.877
The company won't consider tolerating even a one percent risk.

00:23:40.878 --> 00:23:43.088
What's the status of progress?

00:23:43.923 --> 00:23:45.381
This.

00:23:45.382 --> 00:23:47.884
Jeong Jinman's website is currently under construction.

00:23:47.885 --> 00:23:53.640
We are using his own system against him, and developed a murthehelp app in secret.

00:23:53.641 --> 00:23:56.225
Think of it as a secondhand marketplace for weapons.

00:23:56.226 --> 00:23:59.270
Jeong Jinman controlled everything on the website,

00:23:59.271 --> 00:24:01.940
But the app operates as more of an open marketplace.

00:24:01.941 --> 00:24:04.567
As the number of users grow, the data grows with it.

00:24:04.568 --> 00:24:09.489
On the surface level, this app appears to have no relationship with Babylon.

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:11.991
- Jeong Jinman's niece? -  Correct.

00:24:11.992 --> 00:24:13.076
Jeong Jian.

00:24:13.077 --> 00:24:15.370
Jinman's only Achilles' heel.

00:24:15.371 --> 00:24:17.914
Once the number of users exceed a certain threshold,

00:24:17.915 --> 00:24:19.666
We plan to put a bounty on Jeong Jian.

00:24:19.667 --> 00:24:24.003
When we capture the kid, Jinman will come out from the shadows.

00:24:24.004 --> 00:24:28.592
While trying to capture her last year, two entire teams were wiped out.

00:24:29.510 --> 00:24:32.388
One of which was Babylon's main unit.

00:24:36.684 --> 00:24:38.685
- His associates? -  That's right.

00:24:38.686 --> 00:24:42.814
If we start by cutting off the legs, the right arm, then the left :cue

00:24:42.815 --> 00:24:44.983
We can focus on cutting off the head.

00:24:44.984 --> 00:24:48.486
Then we'll be able to recover the server from Jeong Jinman

00:24:48.487 --> 00:24:50.155
