What about that one-eyed asshole from earlier?

00:24:56.036 --> 00:24:58.079
Bale? Did you say hello?

00:24:58.080 --> 00:25:00.749
- Do we really have to work with him? -  Why not?

00:25:01.875 --> 00:25:03.002
Are you scared?

00:25:04.086 --> 00:25:05.295
I'm not scared.

00:25:06.672 --> 00:25:08.549
I'm worried he'll get in the way.

00:25:10.926 --> 00:25:12.177
What do you think, Q?

